{%- comment -%}
  EVERSTORY — buy-box note for the studio-laid-out sheet (Name & Photo Sticker Sheet).

  A product is a pack when custom.pack_sizes is set. Packs have no Size option:
  the size mix is fixed and the studio sizes each photo. Since 2026-09-19 the pack
  is one fixed offer — five photos and a name on one sheet — so there is no
  Designs option to follow any more and this note is static (no variant script).

  Renders nothing on products without pack_sizes (Custom Sticker Sheet, legacy
  products), so it is safe to place on the shared product template.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign pack_sizes = product.metafields.custom.pack_sizes.value -%}
{%- if pack_sizes != blank -%}
  <div class="es-pack-note" data-es-pack-note style="display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:2px;">
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:max(0.875rem,13.5px);line-height:1.6;opacity:0.72;">
      <strong>Sizes</strong> — {{ pack_sizes }}, mixed on one sheet and measured by the longest edge.
      Nothing to choose here; we size each photo.
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:max(0.875rem,13.5px);line-height:1.6;opacity:0.72;">
      <strong>Photos</strong> — upload 5–7 photos. We choose the final five and set the crop, size and layout.
      If a photo cannot be used, we use another suitable upload and email you only if we need a replacement.
      <a href="#es-what-you-get" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">What you'll get</a>
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:max(0.875rem,13.5px);line-height:1.6;opacity:0.72;">
      <strong>Name</strong> — lettered in capitals as its own sticker, in the style you pick.
      Letters A–Z and spaces only; a space starts a new line.
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
